WEBVTT

00:00:08.822 --> 00:00:11.491
Now I will cover the world
in darkness!

00:00:14.744 --> 00:00:17.831
You wont get away with It
Devil Earl!

00:00:21.168 --> 00:00:24.588
That lame theme song
means Justice Man is here...

00:00:25.463 --> 00:00:28.258
Just when it was getting good,
the hero butts in!

00:00:29.301 --> 00:00:31.678
Hang in there!
Don't give up, Devil Earl!

00:00:31.928 --> 00:00:33.471
Kick Justice Man's butt!

00:00:33.722 --> 00:00:35.974
Justice Punch!

00:00:37.893 --> 00:00:40.020
Darn it! He got beat again...

00:00:40.812 --> 00:00:44.858
When will there be a monster
that can defeat Justice Man?

00:00:46.276 --> 00:00:49.112
What? Heroes never lose?

00:00:49.946 --> 00:00:53.074
Why not? Does good always win out?

00:00:53.158 --> 00:00:55.035
But that's so unfair!

00:00:55.327 --> 00:00:57.370
Monsters have things
they want, too!

00:00:57.871 --> 00:01:00.540
And monsters try really hard...

00:01:01.458 --> 00:01:05.337
So why do they always
end up getting killed?

00:01:06.129 --> 00:01:08.965
I root for them!
What about what I think?!

00:01:09.633 --> 00:01:11.635
Monsters are just cooler.

00:01:12.677 --> 00:01:15.722
Why should the popular win,
while the hated lose?

00:01:15.805 --> 00:01:16.806
It's tragic!

00:01:18.099 --> 00:01:19.684
If that's how the world works...

00:01:20.560 --> 00:01:25.774
I'll become the strongest monster,
and I will lose to no one!

00:01:35.408 --> 00:01:36.993
What am I doing here?

00:01:42.499 --> 00:01:45.835
My memories from last night
are so cloudy...

00:02:03.520 --> 00:02:05.647
Through the once tranquil town

00:02:05.689 --> 00:02:07.983
A thunderous roar peals forth

00:02:08.024 --> 00:02:11.903
Watch out! Freak out! Monsters!

00:02:12.821 --> 00:02:14.906
Who ts going to take the lead

00:02:12.821 --> 00:02:14.906
Who is going to take the lead

00:02:15.031 --> 00:02:17.409
When we destroy the evil ones?

00:02:17.617 --> 00:02:22.372
Destruction, contusion...
Loosen up!

00:02:22.497 --> 00:02:24.374
We know, We are...

00:02:24.541 --> 00:02:27.127
HEROES!

00:02:27.252 --> 00:02:28.878
Why were you

00:02:29.004 --> 00:02:31.172
born of evil?

00:02:31.298 --> 00:02:33.216
If you wish to know

00:02:33.383 --> 00:02:35.635
I shall tell!

00:02:35.760 --> 00:02:41.599
This night the punching fist
of glorious justice

00:02:41.808 --> 00:02:45.103
Will shatter your fate apart!

00:02:46.438 --> 00:02:50.984
That word exists for you
and you alone

00:02:51.109 --> 00:02:55.613
Raise your silent fist
to the sky!

00:02:55.739 --> 00:03:00.243
The apostle bears
the weight of solitude

00:03:00.410 --> 00:03:06.458
For a peace not tilled
with hatred

00:03:00.410 --> 00:03:06.458
For a peace not filled
with hatred

00:03:06.583 --> 00:03:09.919
He must fight!

00:03:19.846 --> 00:03:23.641
Regarding last night's attack
on Director Zeimeet,

00:03:23.767 --> 00:03:26.853
it was almost certainly the work of
the "hero hunter," Garou.

00:03:27.145 --> 00:03:29.397
You mean, he is targeting
not just heroes now,

00:03:29.814 --> 00:03:31.274
but the entire Association?

00:03:31.733 --> 00:03:34.319
He was able to defeat
Tank-top Master.

00:03:34.778 --> 00:03:37.364
Ordinary protective details
will not dispel fear.

00:03:37.781 --> 00:03:40.283
THE METAL BAT

00:03:42.452 --> 00:03:44.621
Executives should remain indoors
if possible.

00:03:44.996 --> 00:03:48.500
When going out, they must be
accompanied by a Class S hero.

00:03:48.625 --> 00:03:49.626
Is that realistic?

00:03:49.959 --> 00:03:53.463
Recently, the Class S seem so busy
dealing with monsters.

00:03:54.547 --> 00:03:56.716
The directors are the conduits
to our sponsors.

00:03:56.841 --> 00:03:58.927
Their safety takes precedence.

00:04:00.303 --> 00:04:02.305
Act as a bodyguard
for an executive?

00:04:02.806 --> 00:04:03.807
I refuse.

00:04:04.349 --> 00:04:05.308
"Why not?"

00:04:06.434 --> 00:04:09.104
Because I'm in the middle
of a battle.

00:04:10.605 --> 00:04:11.815
My opponent is down.

00:04:12.232 --> 00:04:15.568
Now I'm going to hit
the boss in his secret lair.

00:04:15.610 --> 00:04:18.696
NEZUMI

00:04:20.949 --> 00:04:23.660
I'm counting on you to
protect us today...

00:04:23.868 --> 00:04:25.995
Mr. Metal I Bat.

00:04:23.868 --> 00:04:25.995
CLASS S, RANK 15
METAL BAT

00:04:26.329 --> 00:04:28.039
They said it's
4 critical assignment,

00:04:28.164 --> 00:04:29.207
but when I got here...

00:04:29.332 --> 00:04:32.961
Association executives are now
targets too, apparently.

00:04:33.253 --> 00:04:37.298
But my boy here insists on trying
"peasant food."

00:04:37.715 --> 00:04:39.801
Wow! Look, Papa!

00:04:39.926 --> 00:04:41.177
There's pudding coming!

00:04:42.762 --> 00:04:44.889
This sushi won't
even total 10,000 yen.

00:04:45.014 --> 00:04:49.811
How amusing to experience
just how inferior it is.

00:04:49.978 --> 00:04:52.564
What is this?
Am Iin Hell?!

00:04:53.815 --> 00:04:55.859
Hey! Don't put your plate
back on the belt!

00:04:56.025 --> 00:04:56.985
Why not?

00:04:57.193 --> 00:04:59.070
They need it to tally your bill.

00:04:59.529 --> 00:05:01.948
Come now, it's only good manners
to return one's plate.

00:05:03.825 --> 00:05:05.910
I said don't put them back!

00:05:06.494 --> 00:05:08.872
The color of this uni
is offputting...

00:05:09.873 --> 00:05:11.166
Perhaps they have caviar?

00:05:11.541 --> 00:05:12.750
What's "chutoro"?

00:05:13.042 --> 00:05:16.045
Can humans even eat tuna
besides otoro?

00:05:16.463 --> 00:05:17.505
Don't put it back!

00:05:18.798 --> 00:05:21.301
The next time a plate goes back,
I kill them both.

00:05:25.889 --> 00:05:26.848
Phone call?

00:05:26.973 --> 00:05:27.974
It's my little sister!

00:05:28.391 --> 00:05:30.727
Stay here while I step away
for a second.

00:05:30.894 --> 00:05:32.145
RESTROOM

00:05:32.645 --> 00:05:33.938
I didn't have a choice.

00:05:34.272 --> 00:05:36.608
An important assignment
suddenly came up.

00:05:36.733 --> 00:05:44.157
MEN

00:05:44.199 --> 00:05:51.039
WOMEN

00:05:51.414 --> 00:05:53.666
I have to hang up. Bye!

00:05:56.085 --> 00:05:58.087
I'm the one who should be crying.

00:05:58.338 --> 00:06:01.007
Last time I do a favor
for some exec!

00:06:02.967 --> 00:06:04.844
Crap! Is it Garou?!

00:06:05.762 --> 00:06:07.430
Papa!

00:06:07.764 --> 00:06:09.891
I don't think that's him.

00:06:10.016 --> 00:06:10.975
Help him!

00:06:11.142 --> 00:06:12.977
That thing has my son!

00:06:13.102 --> 00:06:16.064
That's the Hero Association
executive, all right.

00:06:16.189 --> 00:06:18.024
With his kid— Perfect.

00:06:18.191 --> 00:06:20.235
We're taking the child.

00:06:20.443 --> 00:06:21.653
Hold it.

00:06:23.947 --> 00:06:26.950
No one's taking a step
out of this place.

00:06:30.495 --> 00:06:31.955
They haven't paid yet.

00:06:33.289 --> 00:06:36.751
Charanko said he signed up
on a whim.

00:06:37.126 --> 00:06:45.176
PARTICIPANTS
CHECK-IN GATE

00:06:46.219 --> 00:06:48.012
What name did you register under?

00:06:48.096 --> 00:06:49.973
Uh... Charanko.

00:06:51.140 --> 00:06:53.476
All right. Please write in
your fighting style.

00:06:54.143 --> 00:06:55.061
Fighting style?

00:06:55.144 --> 00:06:57.272
Uh... What was it, now?

00:06:57.313 --> 00:07:00.567
WAITING ROOM - CHARANKO

00:07:01.317 --> 00:07:03.861
This must be
the tournament bracket...

00:07:05.238 --> 00:07:06.489
Some fighters got seeded...

00:07:06.823 --> 00:07:09.450
This Bakuzan guy must be tough.

00:07:09.951 --> 00:07:12.996
In the opposite bracket
Suiryu Is the top seed...

00:07:15.164 --> 00:07:17.959
Yo! Charanko,
from the dojo, right?

00:07:18.042 --> 00:07:19.919
Oh no...
Someone who knows Charanko!

00:07:20.003 --> 00:07:21.671
Hey, what's the matter?

00:07:21.754 --> 00:07:24.048
Surely you haven't forgotten me?

00:07:24.716 --> 00:07:26.342
"Fist of Seltzer Water on the Rocks"?

00:07:26.426 --> 00:07:27.969
That a joke?

00:07:28.344 --> 00:07:30.305
Well, I don't blame you
for being nervous.

00:07:30.847 --> 00:07:33.808
After all, you never could beat me.

00:07:36.561 --> 00:07:38.438
HERO ASSOCIATION HOSPITAL

00:07:39.188 --> 00:07:42.150
He better not be competing
in my place.

00:07:43.526 --> 00:07:45.236
Nah, he wouldn't
be that stupid...

00:07:45.945 --> 00:07:48.823
Wait, Saitama does seem
pretty friggin' stupid.

00:07:49.449 --> 00:07:50.408
Saitama?

00:07:51.034 --> 00:07:53.161
Hey, you're...?

00:07:53.369 --> 00:07:55.830
Are you acquainted with Saitama?

00:07:57.248 --> 00:08:01.461
Charanko, Know why I entered
this tournament?

00:08:01.628 --> 00:08:05.006
Who cares? Just hurry up
and go somewhere else.

00:08:05.381 --> 00:08:07.050
Two reasons.

00:08:07.216 --> 00:08:12.972
One: This Super Fight is ideal for
making a name as a martial artist.

00:08:13.097 --> 00:08:15.975
Master Bang was the champion once.

00:08:16.267 --> 00:08:18.144
The other reason:

00:08:18.227 --> 00:08:20.480
The incident at
the previous tournament.

00:08:21.189 --> 00:08:24.108
A masked fighter named Wolfman
won the championship.

00:08:24.901 --> 00:08:26.527
But after the tournament,

00:08:26.653 --> 00:08:30.156
the real Wolfman
was found unconscious.

00:08:30.948 --> 00:08:33.910
Because of that,
registration under an alias

00:08:33.993 --> 00:08:37.038
and use of headwear
became strictly banned.

00:08:37.246 --> 00:08:38.956
H-Headwear?

00:08:39.499 --> 00:08:41.959
You lied about your fighting style...

00:08:42.126 --> 00:08:44.253
That might be a grey area.

00:08:45.088 --> 00:08:46.506
What happens if they find out?

00:08:46.714 --> 00:08:49.258
You'd be banned for life.

00:08:49.634 --> 00:08:51.094
And after the incident,

00:08:51.302 --> 00:08:54.180
you'll probably be sued and
hit with a heavy fine as well.

00:08:54.514 --> 00:08:56.766
Might even be arrested.

00:08:57.100 --> 00:08:58.976
R-Really...?!

00:08:59.185 --> 00:09:00.520
What's the matter?

00:09:01.104 --> 00:09:02.105
No way...

00:09:03.064 --> 00:09:04.023
You...

00:09:05.692 --> 00:09:08.319
...Know exactly who
the perpetrator was, don't you?

00:09:08.444 --> 00:09:09.445
I'm sate!

00:09:10.613 --> 00:09:13.074
I saw his technique in a video.

00:09:13.449 --> 00:09:14.575
There's no doubt.

00:09:15.034 --> 00:09:16.452
The criminal is...

00:09:17.245 --> 00:09:18.246
...Garou!

00:09:19.539 --> 00:09:21.165
Yo. I'm back.

00:09:22.667 --> 00:09:23.918
Oh hey, Mister!

00:09:24.043 --> 00:09:25.002
Patrolling again?

00:09:25.336 --> 00:09:27.213
I told you not to call me "mister."

00:09:27.714 --> 00:09:28.840
Now lend me that book.

00:09:29.298 --> 00:09:31.050
I still don't want to.

00:09:31.259 --> 00:09:31.884
Huh?

00:09:31.968 --> 00:09:34.303
You know!
Let's read it together!

00:09:39.892 --> 00:09:41.060
Garou?

00:09:41.394 --> 00:09:43.187
There's that narne again.

00:09:43.688 --> 00:09:45.106
It was six months ago...

00:09:45.356 --> 00:09:48.276
Right after it went down
and he was expelled.

00:09:48.484 --> 00:09:49.485
It had to be him.

00:09:49.986 --> 00:09:51.070
"It went down"?

00:09:51.571 --> 00:09:54.115
You were skipping classes,
so you don't know...

00:09:54.490 --> 00:09:57.410
It was a day when Master Bang
was out...

00:10:02.498 --> 00:10:03.499
I'm done.

00:10:03.708 --> 00:10:04.834
Huh?

00:10:04.917 --> 00:10:07.503
There's nothing left to learn
for me here.

00:10:08.504 --> 00:10:09.672
Let's fight for real.

00:10:11.299 --> 00:10:14.677
He'd hidden his true self
as he sharpened his fangs.

00:10:16.304 --> 00:10:17.930
If it hadn't been for him,

00:10:18.014 --> 00:10:20.433
we wouldn't have had to
leave the dojo.

00:10:20.641 --> 00:10:21.517
Damn him!

00:10:21.601 --> 00:10:22.727
That's why I'm here today!

00:10:22.894 --> 00:10:24.854
I'll win this tournament...

00:10:25.980 --> 00:10:27.690
...and get my mojo back!

00:10:28.316 --> 00:10:31.694
I want to Know that I can
hold my own against Garou!

00:10:33.738 --> 00:10:36.949
But I never imagined you,
the runt of the dojo,

00:10:37.033 --> 00:10:38.743
would enter
the Super Fight tourney!

00:10:39.202 --> 00:10:41.037
You got ideas.

00:10:41.120 --> 00:10:43.539
I heard you even call yourself
the "top disciple."

00:10:44.123 --> 00:10:45.625
Don't let it go to your head.

00:10:47.168 --> 00:10:47.960
I see.

00:10:48.628 --> 00:10:52.256
You're saying Saitama might
enter in your place?

00:10:52.423 --> 00:10:53.424
Yeah.

00:10:53.591 --> 00:10:56.469
If by some chance
an amateur manages to get in,

00:10:56.844 --> 00:10:58.054
he'd get himself killed!

00:10:58.304 --> 00:10:59.305
Nothing to worry about.

00:11:00.598 --> 00:11:01.724
Because, you know...

00:11:03.059 --> 00:11:04.101
He's a hero.

00:11:05.269 --> 00:11:08.856
If I'd have known that
Garou would be expelled,

00:11:08.940 --> 00:11:10.691
I'd never have left the dojo.

00:11:11.234 --> 00:11:14.946
Then Master Bang's
top disciple right now

00:11:15.071 --> 00:11:16.614
would be me, Sourface.

00:11:17.031 --> 00:11:18.157
Whatcha think?

00:11:18.241 --> 00:11:22.078
Wanna practice choke holds
until you black out again?

00:11:23.704 --> 00:11:25.581
You left the dojo, right?

00:11:25.832 --> 00:11:26.707
What?

00:11:27.166 --> 00:11:29.544
I, Charanko, took on Garou
by myself.

00:11:30.002 --> 00:11:33.047
That's why I'm here:
to get rid of Garou.

00:11:33.756 --> 00:11:36.926
If he keeps up his hero hunting,
one day, we're gonna meet.

00:11:37.510 --> 00:11:38.594
What I'm saying is...

00:11:38.719 --> 00:11:41.848
someone who runs off shouldn't be
acting like a big shot.

00:11:44.350 --> 00:11:46.727
I'm gonna make you eat those words!

00:11:47.103 --> 00:11:49.313
The Super Fight is
a one-day tournament.

00:11:49.897 --> 00:11:52.149
If by chance you win and move up,

00:11:52.817 --> 00:11:54.527
we'll meet in the ring.

00:11:56.362 --> 00:11:58.781
If that happens, I'll teach you...

00:11:59.156 --> 00:12:02.159
...what it's like to be
in a real fight.

00:12:06.581 --> 00:12:08.249
A real fight...

00:12:11.836 --> 00:12:14.171
I really don't remember
What they're like.

00:12:20.469 --> 00:12:21.804
Did you see that, Papa'?!

00:12:21.888 --> 00:12:23.639
He took care of the monsters
in no time!

00:12:23.764 --> 00:12:26.100
Okay, let me get a few pics.

00:12:26.726 --> 00:12:29.437
Hey, it's still dangerous.
Let's get out of here.

00:12:30.479 --> 00:12:33.316
Venus Peopletrap and I
were no match for you...

00:12:33.983 --> 00:12:38.654
But we expected you to easily
overcome us, Metal Bat.

00:12:39.405 --> 00:12:41.699
You are truly a Class S hero...

00:12:42.158 --> 00:12:44.285
Yet the strong often
mistakenly believe

00:12:44.368 --> 00:12:47.622
they're at the top
of the food chain.

00:12:49.290 --> 00:12:51.500
In fact, I believed so once...

00:12:51.584 --> 00:12:53.169
Not done dying yet, bug?

00:12:53.836 --> 00:12:55.296
Want me to finish you off?

00:12:55.796 --> 00:13:00.217
But then, Centisempai appeared...

00:13:11.187 --> 00:13:12.188
Another one?!

00:13:12.313 --> 00:13:17.193
I will avenge you, little one...

00:13:17.818 --> 00:13:19.362
CENTISEMPAI

00:13:20.821 --> 00:13:22.531
That thing's gross!

00:13:22.740 --> 00:13:24.492
This one's a whole lot bigger!

00:13:27.954 --> 00:13:29.747
What's that smell...?

00:13:41.634 --> 00:13:44.095
LAFRESHIDON

00:13:44.470 --> 00:13:47.223
These things got nothing to do
with Garou, I guess?

00:13:48.641 --> 00:13:50.059
Gah, no use thinking about it!

00:13:53.062 --> 00:13:54.981
I'll just smash 'em!

00:13:55.773 --> 00:13:56.399
That's right!

00:13:56.565 --> 00:13:59.318
No matter what terror he faces,
he stands up and fights.

00:13:59.902 --> 00:14:02.655
I'm saying you don't have to
worry about Saitama.

00:14:03.114 --> 00:14:04.240
Yeah, but...

00:14:04.323 --> 00:14:08.202
He'd never use a false identity
and break the rules.

00:14:08.452 --> 00:14:09.578
After all, he's a hero.

00:14:09.745 --> 00:14:10.830
Uh...uh...

00:14:11.747 --> 00:14:13.749
Well, in that case, it's okay.

00:14:14.875 --> 00:14:15.835
Yeah!

00:14:22.758 --> 00:14:24.301
So much time to kill...

00:14:26.637 --> 00:14:28.097
And this is Watchdog Man.

00:14:28.180 --> 00:14:29.473
HERO ALMANAC

00:14:30.558 --> 00:14:32.935
Just looks like a guy
in a dog suit to me.

00:14:33.978 --> 00:14:35.104
Is he tough?

00:14:35.396 --> 00:14:36.397
Of course!

00:14:36.605 --> 00:14:38.024
He's a Class S hero.

00:14:38.899 --> 00:14:40.443
Class S, Rank 12, eh?

00:14:40.985 --> 00:14:44.822
He keeps watch over City Q from
his lookout in Watchdog Plaza.

00:14:45.281 --> 00:14:47.366
He's always hanging out there!

00:14:47.992 --> 00:14:48.951
Really...

00:14:50.453 --> 00:14:53.956
Warning! Emergency evacuation!
Warning! Emergency evacuation!

00:14:54.373 --> 00:14:57.668
A monster has appeared in
the shopping district of City S.

00:14:58.210 --> 00:14:59.628
Threat level: Demon.

00:15:00.671 --> 00:15:04.300
The Class S hero Metal Bat
Is currently engaging the monster.

00:15:05.301 --> 00:15:08.512
Citizens outside are requested
to move indoors quickly.

00:15:09.055 --> 00:15:09.889
Mister?!

00:15:09.972 --> 00:15:11.182
You heard her.

00:15:12.141 --> 00:15:14.018
Hurry up and get home.

00:15:14.143 --> 00:15:15.102
Okay!

00:15:16.353 --> 00:15:17.354
We repeat...

00:15:17.813 --> 00:15:21.108
Warning! Emergency evacuation!
Warning! Emergency evacuation!

00:15:35.081 --> 00:15:36.999
Centipede Parade!

00:15:46.759 --> 00:15:48.427
Quite an obstinate enemy.

00:15:48.594 --> 00:15:50.971
I understand how
he could beat Centikohai.

00:15:51.430 --> 00:15:53.182
What are you damn worms after?

00:15:53.724 --> 00:15:55.643
Why target that man and his son?

00:15:58.020 --> 00:16:00.898
If you beat us, we'll tell you.

00:16:03.275 --> 00:16:06.987
At last, my Hypno-scent
is taking effect...

00:16:07.321 --> 00:16:08.906
Excellent!

00:16:15.913 --> 00:16:17.039
Losing...consciousness...

00:16:24.505 --> 00:16:27.216
Eternal rest is yours!

00:16:36.559 --> 00:16:39.061
He's hitting. ...himself?!

00:16:42.314 --> 00:16:44.233
He's gone mad!

00:16:49.738 --> 00:16:52.032
That cleared my head!

00:16:52.241 --> 00:16:52.950
What?!

00:16:53.075 --> 00:16:54.952
His power has increased?!

00:16:56.245 --> 00:16:59.081
It shouldn't be possible to
undo the sedative so easily...!

00:17:00.291 --> 00:17:01.625
What happened?

00:17:01.917 --> 00:17:05.045
Once my fighting spirit's up,
I can take almost anything.

00:17:06.422 --> 00:17:09.925
You really slapped the hell
out of me just now.

00:17:11.302 --> 00:17:14.263
But I'm a nice guy...

00:17:15.264 --> 00:17:16.807
So one whack each...

00:17:16.974 --> 00:17:18.767
and we'll call it even!

00:17:30.279 --> 00:17:32.573
It's been a while since I felt
that much fight in me...

00:17:36.493 --> 00:17:39.121
I didn't ask the monsters
what they were after!

00:17:39.580 --> 00:17:40.956
Totally slipped my mind...

00:17:42.875 --> 00:17:45.211
Looks like theyre uniryured.

00:17:45.377 --> 00:17:46.629
Hey, wake up, you two!

00:17:46.879 --> 00:17:48.589
Need a good punch to get you up?!

00:17:50.299 --> 00:17:51.342
We're here to help!

00:17:51.926 --> 00:17:53.385
We'll help you fight!

00:17:53.677 --> 00:17:54.845
CLASS C
MOHICAN
CLASS B
PINEAPPLE

00:17:55.137 --> 00:17:57.223
I just finished up.

00:17:57.431 --> 00:17:58.974
— What?!
— What?!

00:18:00.768 --> 00:18:03.145
Thank goodness for Metal Bat.

00:18:03.562 --> 00:18:05.481
Now the safety of the director
and his son is...

00:18:06.148 --> 00:18:07.816
Hmm? What is it?

00:18:07.942 --> 00:18:11.987
Centisempai and Centikohai
appeared one after the other...

00:18:12.821 --> 00:18:13.906
That means...

00:18:14.114 --> 00:18:15.074
It can't be!

00:18:15.491 --> 00:18:17.618
Remember what happened
two years ago?

00:18:17.910 --> 00:18:19.995
If he appears again...

00:18:20.162 --> 00:18:22.998
Right. Mere bodyguards
won't be enough...

00:18:23.999 --> 00:18:25.834
The entire city will be leveled.

00:18:32.174 --> 00:18:33.175
That's...

00:18:33.676 --> 00:18:35.761
The giant bug monster, Centichoro!

00:18:38.013 --> 00:18:40.057
It's threat level Dragon!

00:18:40.849 --> 00:18:41.433
Dragon?

00:18:42.017 --> 00:18:43.978
I'll request some Class S backup.

00:18:44.228 --> 00:18:45.479
Let's keep clear for now.

00:18:45.854 --> 00:18:47.898
Bastard's here for those two
over there.

00:18:48.649 --> 00:18:50.776
Get them to safety
while I occupy him.

00:18:51.944 --> 00:18:52.987
Fast as you can!

00:18:53.570 --> 00:18:54.571
Hurry!

00:18:54.863 --> 00:18:57.866
Now then... What to do?

00:18:59.868 --> 00:19:01.537
Is he looking this way?

00:19:05.124 --> 00:19:06.208
You'll not escape!

00:19:06.333 --> 00:19:07.751
It's charging!

00:19:10.045 --> 00:19:12.006
Don't look back! Run!

00:19:18.554 --> 00:19:20.180
It's trggin' hard!

00:19:20.514 --> 00:19:21.932
Out of the way!

00:19:30.441 --> 00:19:32.568
Tagged with a full swing
and not even a crack...

00:19:32.901 --> 00:19:37.197
But the bastard protected
his face-thing when I went in.

00:19:38.407 --> 00:19:40.242
That's where I need to bash it!

00:19:51.003 --> 00:19:52.087
He's coming after us!

00:19:52.504 --> 00:19:54.590
No, look! On top!

00:19:55.299 --> 00:19:56.258
That's...!

00:19:57.593 --> 00:19:58.677
Killer Move!

00:19:59.386 --> 00:20:00.512
Fighting Spirit...

00:20:00.721 --> 00:20:03.766
...Dragon Pummelin'!

00:20:02.598 --> 00:20:03.766
FIGHTING SPIRIT DRAGON PUMMELING

00:20:12.024 --> 00:20:15.027
Centipede Undulation!

00:20:13.400 --> 00:20:14.985
CENTIPEDE UNDULATION

00:20:18.280 --> 00:20:20.115
So this is what
Level Dragon is like!

00:20:20.449 --> 00:20:23.577
Mankind wasn't meant to face
this kind of thing!

00:20:25.704 --> 00:20:27.289
Warning! Emergency evacuation!

00:20:27.790 --> 00:20:33.087
A new monster with a threat level
of Dragon has appeared in City S.

00:20:34.296 --> 00:20:36.173
— Emergency shelters
— What happened to the heroes?

00:20:36.298 --> 00:20:37.132
— are no guarantee of safety.
— Were they defeated?

00:20:37.216 --> 00:20:39.301
— Evacuate as far as possible
— It's the end of the world!

00:20:39.343 --> 00:20:40.719
— outside the city.
— We have to get away!

00:20:41.178 --> 00:20:44.139
Well, well
Everyone's all excited.

00:20:44.223 --> 00:20:47.935
Level Dragon gets announced,
and suddenly it's a party.

00:20:48.560 --> 00:20:52.815
I wonder if Metal Bat will
still be alive when I find him.

00:20:57.152 --> 00:20:58.237
Metal Bat?

00:20:59.154 --> 00:21:00.114
How did he...?!

00:21:00.697 --> 00:21:02.658
Oh, that's how.

00:21:03.325 --> 00:21:07.037
A Class S beaten up by
a monster other than me?

00:21:07.287 --> 00:21:08.247
I wasted my time—

00:21:09.498 --> 00:21:11.041
Better get back to it.

00:21:11.583 --> 00:21:15.337
Hold it right there, Metal Bat!

00:21:15.629 --> 00:21:16.422
Huh?

00:21:16.505 --> 00:21:18.340
You're alive.
That changes things!

00:21:20.884 --> 00:21:22.845
My second Class S...

00:21:23.220 --> 00:21:24.763
From here on, I'm your opponent.

00:21:25.097 --> 00:21:26.265
I'm hunting you.

00:21:26.348 --> 00:21:26.974
Huh?!

00:21:27.057 --> 00:21:28.267
You serious, dumbass?

00:21:28.851 --> 00:21:30.477
Can't you see that centipede?

00:21:30.686 --> 00:21:31.854
Get your ass out—

00:21:37.151 --> 00:21:38.110
Now I see...

00:21:38.735 --> 00:21:42.114
You're that human who calls himself
a "hero-hunting monster."

00:21:42.614 --> 00:21:45.033
That's right. I am Garou.

00:21:47.286 --> 00:21:49.246
You can see I'm busy.

00:21:49.538 --> 00:21:52.583
Come at me, and I'll take
that crazeball head of yours...

00:21:52.875 --> 00:21:55.878
and crack it wide open!

00:22:07.014 --> 00:22:11.977
We painted different dreams
into our hearts

00:22:12.060 --> 00:22:16.773
With the struggles that we faced
In the past

00:22:12.060 --> 00:22:16.773
With the struggles that we faced
in the past

00:22:17.316 --> 00:22:22.779
Will the future call
or Will it slip away?

00:22:22.905 --> 00:22:27.784
There's just so much
that we don't know

00:22:28.076 --> 00:22:33.373
But one day, well make peace
within ourselves

00:22:28.076 --> 00:22:33.373
But one day, we'll make peace
within ourselves

00:22:33.624 --> 00:22:39.046
Weil be able to forgive
everything in our past

00:22:39.087 --> 00:22:44.218
We tell ourselves to forget,
but nothing seems to fade

00:22:44.301 --> 00:22:48.263
That's what we are to each other

00:22:48.347 --> 00:22:54.645
If you hold out your hand
Youll see the bonds that show us

00:22:54.811 --> 00:22:59.149
That kindness Is the true strength

00:22:59.274 --> 00:23:05.614
Theyre something that I need
To keep on moving on

00:23:05.739 --> 00:23:10.953
So I promise that I'll come back

00:23:11.119 --> 00:23:16.917
I promise that I'll come back to you

00:23:26.885 --> 00:23:29.763
Whoa! They're saying City S
is at threat level Dragon.

00:23:29.972 --> 00:23:31.306
Will they be okay?

00:23:31.640 --> 00:23:34.643
Ladies, are you on your way
to watch Super Fight?

00:23:34.977 --> 00:23:36.144
Mind if I come with?

00:23:36.812 --> 00:23:38.939
It's been so long,
I forgot how to get there.

00:23:39.481 --> 00:23:40.399
Aren't you...

00:23:40.482 --> 00:23:41.233
Yeah!

00:23:41.692 --> 00:23:43.527
So it's all right then?

00:23:45.195 --> 00:23:49.866
THE MARTIAL ARTS TOURNAMENT
